sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant App as Flutter App
    participant API as services/api
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant Worker as Background Worker

    User->>App: Confirm Account Deletion
    App->>API: DELETE /api/v1/account
    API->>DB: Set Status DELETION_PENDING & Revoke Sessions/Prekeys
    API-->>App: Account Disabled Notice
    Note over Worker: 30-Day Permanent Purge Job Runs
    Worker->>DB: Delete User Profile, Phone Identity, Device Keys
